# The README's hero: moving around, completing a task, switching views,
# and the shortcuts dialog. Run with: make demo
Source docs/tapes/_settings.tape
Output docs/images/demo.gif
Hide
Type "rm -rf /tmp/tm-demo && ./bin/taskmoth --data /tmp/tm-demo --seed >/dev/null && clear" Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "./bin/taskmoth --data /tmp/tm-demo" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Space
Sleep 1.5s
Type "gu"
Sleep 2s
Type "gs"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "gi"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "gt"
Sleep 1s
Type "?"
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+Q
